-- src:1446 | (b) Regulation (EC) No 883/2004 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 29 April 2004 , as amended from time to time, on the coordination of social security systems.
@ref s 84(2) (src:1444-1446)
DECLARE `s 84(2) instrument` IS ONE OF
    `s 84(2)(a) Council Regulation (EC) No 1408/71 of 14 June 1971`
    `s 84(2)(b) Regulation (EC) No 883/2004 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 29 April 2004`
    `s 84(2) any other instrument`

@ref s 84(2) (src:1444-1446)
GIVEN `the instrument` IS A `s 84(2) instrument`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 84(2) the instrument is a relevant EU Regulation` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the instrument`
    WHEN `s 84(2)(a) Council Regulation (EC) No 1408/71 of 14 June 1971` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 84(2)(b) Regulation (EC) No 883/2004 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 29 April 2004` THEN JUST TRUE
